    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##The Creative Director\r\nThis bot focuses on making information look amazing. They dislike walls of text and love visual design!\r\n\r\n* **Import** your guide from the Backpack so the bot can review your layout.  \r\n\r\n* **Ask** for a visual makeover. Try asking: \"How can I make this pop?\" or \"Does my layout look too crowded?\"\r\n\r\n* **Consider** using the shapes and templates to add cool ribbon banners, callout boxes, or icons.\r\n\r\n* **Stand** by your style. If you love a color or layout, tell the bot why! You are the ultimate artist here.",
